    "images_with_text_scrolling_DnHdTj": {
      "type": "images-with-text-scrolling",
      "blocks": {
        "item_itFkKd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Enrolment.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Purchase Seats for our Cooperative Education Course",
            "content": "<p>Give your students the opportunity to explore career paths through Cooperative Education!</p><p>Co-op is a valuable experience for high school students, but it can be challenging for private schools to manage due to logistical and administrative hurdles. That’s where we come in. OEO takes care of <strong>everything</strong>, including:</p><p>On-site visits</p><p>Ministry reporting (e.g., ONSIS data collection, report cards)</p><p>Personalized support for your students</p><p>Partnering with us is cost-effective and efficient. Purchase a block of <strong>10+ Co-op seats</strong> for your school and let us do the heavy lifting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_KqcqgF": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GoogleClassroom.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Fill Gaps in Your Curriculum",
            "content": "<p>Not every private school can offer every course every year—that’s where OEO can help. Whether it’s due to low enrollment or a lack of specialized instructors, we provide <strong>individual courses</strong> for students who need them.</p><p>We handle:</p><p>Teaching</p><p>Grading</p><p>Ministry reporting (e.g., ONSIS compliance)</p><p>Our flexible online platform ensures your students can access the courses they need to succeed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_q7RNJP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/feedback.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Why Partner with OEO?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Save Time:</strong> We handle the administration, teaching, and reporting.<br/><br/><strong>Cost-Effective:</strong> Flexible options for both small and large-scale needs.<br/><br/><strong>Ministry Compliant:</strong> All reporting, grading, and data collection meet Ontario Ministry of Education requirements.<br/><br/><strong>Student Success:</strong> High-quality instruction and a seamless learning experience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kD9H4X": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Interactive3.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Let’s Work Together",
            "content": "<p>Interested in partnering with OEO? Whether you’re considering our Co-op program or want to fill gaps in your curriculum, we’d love to help your school thrive.</p><p>📩 <strong>Contact Us:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:info@ontarioeducationonline.ca\" target=\"_blank\">info@ontarioeducationonline.ca</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3KFe79": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Flexible.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Flexible Scheduling",
            "content": "<p>We understand the importance of flexibility in education. With Ontario Education Online, you have the freedom to set your own pace. Access course materials and complete assignments at a time that suits your individual schedule, allowing you to balance your academic commitments with other aspects of your life.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_RdmipC": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/teachers.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Teacher Support",
            "content": "<p>Our qualified Ontario teachers are dedicated to your success. Through Google Classroom, you can easily communicate with your teachers, seeking guidance and clarification whenever needed. Take advantage of virtual office hours and personalized support to ensure you have the assistance required to excel in your studies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_GagHap": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/feedback.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Assessment and Feedback",
            "content": "<p>Experience a transparent and fair assessment process at Ontario Education Online. Submit assignments through Google Classroom, where teachers provide constructive feedback to help you grow academically. Stay informed about your progress and take control of your learning journey.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_E4KqeP": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/progress.png",
