            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Graduation and Beyond",
            "content": "<p>Upon successful completion of your courses, Ontario Education Online ensures a smooth transition to the next phase of your educational journey. Receive your well-earned diploma and explore various post-secondary options, equipped with the knowledge and skills needed for success.</p>"
